            <div class="stream__row"><code>09:41:12</code><code>refund.issued</code><span>billing.example.com</span><span class="state"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Delivered, attempt 3</span></div>
