        </div>

        <div class="panel" role="tabpanel" id="p-typed" aria-labelledby="t-typed" tabindex="0">
          <p class="panel__say">Relay reads each payload and gives every field a type.</p>
          <figure class="insp is-wired" data-insp="" data-on="amount">
            <div class="insp__bar"><code>evt_1042</code><span>Received from billing.example.com</span><span class="insp__to">Inferred by Relay</span></div>
            <div class="insp__panes">
